## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Next.js Server Components**: `layout.tsx` and `AuthSync.tsx` are server components that call `auth0.getSession()`. For Vitest component tests, we cannot render these directly. Tests will target client components only, wrapping them in the necessary providers (`DocumentProvider`). The root layout is tested indirectly via Playwright E2E.

> [!WARNING]
> **Chart.js Canvas**: The `Doughnut` chart from `react-chartjs-2` renders to `<canvas>`, which isn't accessible via DOM queries. The User Dashboard test will assert the percentage text overlay (`{percent}%`) and document count text, NOT the canvas internals.

> [!NOTE]
> **`next/navigation` mocking**: Client components use `useRouter()` and `usePathname()` from `next/navigation`. Vitest tests will mock these via `vi.mock("next/navigation")`. Similarly, `next/image` will be mocked to render plain `<img>` tags.

